OL,3,AYellow weather warnings issued as
OL,4,Athunderstorms and flooding forecast
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow weather warnings have been
OL,7,Fissued by the Met Office as heavy rain
OL,8,Fand thunderstorms are forecast to break
OL,9,Fout over parts of the UK later this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FThe warnings span Wednesday and
OL,13,FThursday and include parts of east
OL,14,FWales, the Midlands, northern England,
OL,15,FEast Anglia and southern England -
OL,16,Fincluding London.
OL,18,FIt is likely to be the one of the most
OL,19,Fwidespread outbreaks of heavy rain
OL,20,Facross southern and central parts of
OL,21,Fthe UK this summer.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
