OL,3,ALockerbie bombing trial postponed days
OL,4,Abefore it was due to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FAl-Marimi has denied building the bomb
OL,7,Fthat destroyed Pan Am Flight 103 on 21
OL,8,FDecember 1988, killing 270 people.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
